pyrcl (lauterbach-trace32-rcl) 1.1.6: _rc/hlinknet.py, _rc/_library.py, _rc/_address.py,
_rc/_practice.py, rcl.py

Ported into crates/t32rcl/src/frame.rs, link.rs, wait.rs, wire.rs and value.rs: the NETTCP
